\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换图片</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-gray-800\">全球招生网络</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">覆盖30+国家的招生网络，为教育机构提供全球生源</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:240px\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换图片</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-gray-800\">数据驱动决策</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">基于大数据的招生策略分析，提升招生效率</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:240px\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换图片</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-gray-800\">定制化服务</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">根据机构需求量身定制招生解决方案</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
