    {
      "id": "about",
      "title": "关于我们",
      "html": "<section class=\"min-h-screen bg-white py-16\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-gray-800\">关于 Bristh Enrollment Partners</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center\">\n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n        <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:400px\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换图片</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800\">我们的使命</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">Bristh Enrollment Partners (BEP) 成立于2015年，致力于为全球教育机构提供专业的招生解决方案。我们通过创新的招生策略和全球网络，帮助教育机构实现招生目标。</p>\n        \n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800\">核心价值</h3>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-600\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2 mt-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>专业 - 10年+教育招生行业经验</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2 mt-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>创新 - 持续探索招生新模式</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2 mt-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>全球化 - 覆盖30+国家的招生网络</span>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
