    {
      "id": "services",
      "title": "业务进展",
      "html": "<section class=\"min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-16\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-gray-800\">业务进展与成就</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-800\">招生数据</h3>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center mb-6\">\n          <div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-blue-600 mr-4\">10,000+</div>\n          <div class=\"text-gray-600\">2025年成功招生人数</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:240px\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换图表</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-800\">合作伙伴</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">我们已与全球200+教育机构建立长期合作关系，包括:</p>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-600\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>30所全球顶尖大学</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>50所国际中学</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span>120所职业培训机构</span>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800\">近期项目</h3>\n      <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-800\">亚洲教育峰会2026</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">作为主要合作伙伴参与组织亚洲教育峰会，成功促成30+教育机构合作意向</p>\n          <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:200px\">\n              <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点击替换活动照片</div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-800\">招生数字化平台</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-600\">2025年推出全新招生数字化平台，提升招生效率40%</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
      "inNav": true
