      "id": "contact",
      "title": "联系我们",
      "html": "<section class=\"min-h-screen bg-white py-16\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-gray-800\">联系我们</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12\">\n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800\">联系方式</h3>\n        <div class=\"space-y-6 text-gray-600\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-medium\">电话咨询</p>\n              <p>+86 10 8888 6666</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-medium\">电子邮件</p>\n              <p>contact@bep.com</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"flex items-start\">\n            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"></path>\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-medium\">办公地址</p>\n              <p>北京市朝阳区建国路88号SOHO现代城C座1806</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800\">发送消息</h3>\n        <form class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"name\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">姓名</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500\">\n          </div>\n          \n          <div>\n            <label for=\"email\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">电子邮件</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500\">\n          </div>\n          \n          <div>\n            <label for=\"message\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">留言内容</label>\n            <textarea id=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition w-full\">发送消息</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
